Title 1. Government Organization.(§§ 1-101 – 1-1518.01)
Title 2. Government Administration.(§§ 2-101 – 2-1936)
Title 3. District of Columbia Boards and Commissions.(§§ 3-101 – 3-1481)
Title 4. Public Care Systems.(§§ 4-105 – 4-2101)
